  domainId:"vehicles", displayOrder:1, dataStatus:"demo",
  roleInSystem:"Designs, builds and sells motorcycles, scooters and mopeds through thousands of dealers, mostly in small towns and villages, and exports commuter bikes to Africa, Latin America and South-East Asia. Petrol bikes still dominate; electric scooters are a fast-growing slice made by the same incumbents plus Ather and Ola.",
