  valuePoolDescription:"Market leaders hold large shares in narrow niches: ZF CV Control Systems (formerly WABCO India) in truck air brakes, Gabriel and Endurance in two-wheeler suspension and brakes, Jamna Auto in truck leaf springs, JTEKT India and Rane in steering, Suprajit in control cables and ASK Automotive in two-wheeler brake shoes. A proposed ABS mandate for all new two-wheelers (draft of Jun 2025) would add an estimated ₹7,300 Cr a year of braking content (Business Standard).",
  bottlenecks:["Validation and safety homologation for every new model", "Imported electronics for ABS and stability control", "Aluminium and steel price swings"],
